# The build, the data pipeline and every CI run happen on Linux, and the
# data-store is committed JSON that must diff cleanly across machines. Pin the
# repository to LF so a Windows checkout cannot introduce a whole-file diff by
# doing nothing but existing.
#
# Without this, GitHub Desktop's default core.autocrlf=true rewrites the working
# tree to CRLF on checkout while the pipeline writes LF, so every store file
# alternates line endings depending on which side touched it last.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and generated assets must never be line-ending-normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
